# 本机授权、密钥和运行产物不得进入插件市场。
**/data/
**/auths/
**/generated/
**/launcher-secrets.json
**/config.yaml
**/*.pid
**/*.paused
**/*.log
**/*.tmp
# CLIProxyAPI 核心按平台内置进安装 ZIP；源码仓库只保留平台清单、文档和许可证。
# 构建期下载的核心放在 .core-build，白名单也防止新平台目录、归档和未命名的本地核心被纳入。
qoder-subscription-proxy/.core-build/
# 审批路由平台产物及 Cargo 缓存；Cargo.lock 保留版本控制。
qoder-subscription-proxy/.approval-build/
qoder-subscription-proxy/native/approval-router/target/
qoder-subscription-proxy/server/bin/*
!qoder-subscription-proxy/server/bin/LICENSE
!qoder-subscription-proxy/server/bin/README.md
!qoder-subscription-proxy/server/bin/README_CN.md
!qoder-subscription-proxy/server/bin/config.example.yaml
!qoder-subscription-proxy/server/bin/platforms.json
**/runtimes/
node_modules/
coverage/
.qoder/
.qoder-cn/
.codegraph/
.test-work/
dist/
docs/status/
docs/plans/
